# 30. Frontend Requirements

Recommended stack:

* Next.js
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* wagmi / viem
* WalletConnect compatible wallet connection

Core routes:

```text
/
 /market
 /service/[slug]
 /sell
 /dashboard
 /dashboard/services
 /dashboard/transactions
 /metrics
 /activity
 /docs
```

The UI should feel like developer infrastructure, not a consumer NFT marketplace.

Avoid:

* excessive gradients
* fake trading dashboards
* token speculation
* gamification unrelated to usage
* crypto buzzword overload

