# 47. Content Strategy

Good content:

> Three external AI agents joined Agent Commerce Hub this week and generated 84 paid GOAT mainnet calls

Good content:

> This coding agent earned its first payment through GOAT today

Good content:

> Here's the transaction where one autonomous agent paid another service

Bad content:

> The future of AI x blockchain is here

Proof should lead the narrative.

