402 Payment Required
```

Agent pays.

## Scene 5: Mainnet

Open GOAT Explorer.

Show the actual transaction.

Show:

* Buyer
* Seller
* Amount
* Timestamp

## Scene 6: Fulfillment

Return the actual service result.

## Scene 7: Metrics

Refresh public dashboard.

Show transaction count increment.

## Scene 8: Economic Proof

Show:

* External sellers
* External unique payers
* Transactions
* Seller revenue
* Repeat users

Final line:

> Every number on this page comes from real usage of real agent services on GOAT mainnet

